        "content": "<p>I'm not sure if <a class=\"message-link\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/270676-lean4/topic/No.20DecidableEq.20instance.20for.20Except.3F/near/575178716\">#lean4 &gt; No DecidableEq instance for Except? @ 💬</a>  addresses the problem, but I miss an instance of <code>DecidableEq</code> for String.Slice.<br>\nI tried to define one myself, but got stuck in proving s1 = s2 based on String.Slice.beq s1 s2, which is s1.copy == s2.copy (with s1 s2 : String.Slice).<br>\nAny suggestions?</p>",
        "id": 584078053,
        "sender_full_name": "Stefan Kusterer",
        "timestamp": 1775592985
    },
    {
        "content": "<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">slice1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Slice</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"nicotine\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">startInclusive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨⟨</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decide</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">endExclusive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨⟨</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decide</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">startInclusive_le_endExclusive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decide</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">slice2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Slice</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"iconic\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">startInclusive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨⟨</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decide</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">endExclusive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨⟨</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decide</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">startInclusive_le_endExclusive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decide</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- info: true -/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">-- both are \"ico\"</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">slice1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">slice2</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">slice1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≠</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">slice2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">ne_of_apply_ne</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Slice</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decide</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
